<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD TEAM CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the World Team Cup tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Blue Group</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Haarhuis/Jacco Eltingh beat Stich/Martin Sinner 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Netherlands won 2-1</p>
<p>Red Group</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussi (Australia) beat Pete Sampras (U.S.)  4-6 6-4</p>
<p>0-1 (Sampras withdrew injured)</p>
<p>Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-3 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>Tie level 1-1, to be completed on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
